nBecause `RbConfig::CONFIG['host_cpu']` returns `aarch64`, not `arm`.\r\n\r\n### What did you expect to see?\r\nI expect that `PLATFORM.architecture` returns `x86_64`, not `x86`.\r\n\r\n### What did you see instead?\r\nI saw that `PLATFORM.architecture` returns `x86`, not `x86_64`.\r\n\r\nSee [TROUBLESHOOTING.md](https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/master/TROUBLESHOOTING.md) for how to diagnose problems better.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"alto-ruby","id":122473768,"node_id":"U_kgDOB0zNKA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122473768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alto-ruby","html_url":"https://github.com/alto-ruby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alto-ruby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alto-ruby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alto-ruby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alto-ruby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alto-ruby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alto-ruby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alto-ruby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alto-ruby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alto-ruby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/31782/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/31782/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}